
### Get All Books
GET http://localhost:5000/api/books

###

### Get Book by ID
GET http://localhost:5000/api/books/6afd42943f81ec7e1e259331

### Delete Book
DELETE http://localhost:5000/api/books/6afd42943f81ec7e1e259331
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_JWT_TOKEN



### Get My Borrow History
GET http://localhost:5000/api/borrows
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_JWT_TOKEN


### Return Book
DELETE http://localhost:5000/api/borrows/PASTE_BORROW_ID_HERE
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_JWT_TOKEN


### Create Borrow
POST http://localhost:5000/api/borrows
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_JWT_TOKEN

{
  "bookId": "6afd42943f81ec7e1e259331",
  "returnDate": "2026-12-02T00:00:00.000Z"
}


### Test API 404 Handler
GET http://localhost:5000/api/unknown-route

###

